---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LeadershipTree from '../components/LeadershipTree.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<Layout 
  title={`Leadership Hierarchy Tree – ${siteConfig.groupName}`}
  description="Explore the leadership hierarchy tree of Scout Des Cèdres Groupe Saint Jean Marc: Chef de Groupe, Conseil de Groupe, and Section Unit Leaders."
>
  <!-- Page Header Banner -->
  <section class="bg-cedar-950 text-sand-50 py-12 sm:py-20 border-b border-cedar-900">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
      <span class="inline-block px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-gold-500 text-cedar-950">
        Chain of Leadership
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-sand-50">
        Group Leadership Hierarchy Tree
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sand-300 text-sm sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        100% volunteer-driven. Our chefs and council members dedicate their time every week to guide the youth of Saint Jean Marc.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive Hierarchy Tree Section -->
  <section class="py-8 sm:py-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-6 sm:mb-8">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-cedar-950">
        Organizational Tree
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-500 mt-1">
        Hover over any leader to highlight their responsibilities and branch.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Tree Component -->
    <LeadershipTree />
  </section>

  <!-- Leadership Philosophy & Formation Note -->
  <section class="pb-16 sm:pb-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-sand-100 rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 border-2 border-cedar-800/15 shadow-tactile space-y-5 sm:space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cedar-900">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cedar-700"></span>
        <span>Formation & Training</span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-cedar-950">
        How Leaders Are Formed
      </h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          In our scout tradition, leadership is not a title—it is an act of service (<em>Servir</em>). The vast majority of our chefs began in the group as young Gramiz or Kochefe, taking their promise at the altar of Saint Jean Marc before rising through the ranks.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before taking responsibility for a unit, each leader undergoes rigorous pedagogical, psychological, and outdoor first-aid training camps, adhering strictly to the national guidelines of the Lebanese Scout Federation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-stone-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="text-xs text-stone-600">
          Interested in volunteering with the leadership or parents' council?
        </div>
        <a 
          href={`https://wa.me/${siteConfig.contact.phoneRaw}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hello! I would like to volunteer or learn more about joining the Saint Jean Marc leadership team.')}`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-scout-primary text-xs whitespace-nowrap w-full sm:w-auto text-center justify-center"
        >
          Message Chef de Groupe
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
